// AWS Config Recording Disabled  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1562.008
// Detects disabling or deletion of AWS Config recording or delivery (StopConfigurationRecorder, DeleteConfigurationRecorder,…
// False positives: Approved changes to AWS Config setup.
// Source: rules/defense-evasion/config-disable-recorder.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^StopConfigurationRecorder$/i or eventName=/^DeleteConfigurationRecorder$/i or eventName=/^DeleteDeliveryChannel$/i or eventName=/^DeleteConfigRule$/i eventSource=/^config\.amazonaws\.com$/i
